+     the 0x1000a arm, 0xbb479e increments it at the tail of the sequence
+     branch -- so it is a monotone step counter, not a selector, and no input
+     can move it backwards.  The flag at 0xb5dbec has exactly one setter,
+     0xbb4964 in the **0x10016** arm, and only when the third argument is 9.
+
